# Bags Status drill-down

Three levels only: status tile → event date (bags, kg, destination) → bag list.

One Windhoek calendar day plus the same destination is one cluster. Three
Erongo timeslots on the same date are one event. Do not open bag detail on
the first click.

The date is when the bag **changed status**, not when it was scanned at sieving.
This applies to Sold and to the briquette-plant / pallet statuses.
